✅ Summary
| Aspect       | List                      | Set          |
| ------------ | ------------------------- | ------------ |
| Duplicates   | ✅ Yes                     | ❌ No         |
| Order        | ✅ Maintains               | ❌ Not always |
| Index Access | ✅ Yes                     | ❌ No         |
| Use Case     | Ordered & duplicate items | Unique items |
